{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Mad Mew Mew (Pink)\n👻 A ghost from the Blook family, the same one who in Undertale possessed the training dummy as \"Mad Dummy\" and, in the Switch version, a Mew Mew animatronic as \"Mad Mew Mew\".","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mad_Mew_Mew_Pink.gif","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":220,"height":186},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Alphys**\nShe gave Asgore the Mew Mew figure that Pink ends up possessing — the indirect origin of everything that happens to him in Ch.5.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nHe keeps the figure as his shop's mascot, unaware of what it hides until the Dark World brings it to life.","x":420,"y":-380,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Pink_screenshot_asgore_tell_that_she_is_the_mascot.png","x":420,"y":-600,"width":220,"height":165},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Cristal Oscuro**\nFifth and final confirmed holder, one per chapter — the hardest of the five to find.","x":420,"y":80,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nShe's considered a direct parallel to Kris: both are \"vessels\" controlled by an external entity, and both share a body with that entity.","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Border_screenshot_Pink_with_ghost_when_they_split.png","x":-130,"y":700,"width":220,"height":124},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**The parallel with Kris**\nBoth she and Kris are a body shared between a will of their own and an external force controlling it, and in both cases that force can separate from the \"vessel\".","x":-680,"y":220,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"3"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Seam and the reveal of the crystals**\nUpon handing over the five Shadow Crystals (Jevil, Spamton NEO, the Knight, the Old Man, and Pink), Seam finally reveals what they are: \"the power of lost dreams\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote].","x":700,"y":320,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"1"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**The mirror with Gerson Boom**\nGerson (Ch.4) is a peaceful shopkeeper key to the plot; Pink (Ch.5) is an optional boss irrelevant to the main plot — near-exact reverses of each other.","x":-800,"y":-450,"width":300,"height":250,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/alphys_sprite_transparent_v2.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":121,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shadow_Crystal_item.webp","x":420,"y":-130,"width":140,"height":180},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Seam_Face.webp","x":700,"y":110,"width":223,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Pink_face_possessed.gif","x":-924,"y":437,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/old-man-gerson.png","x":-1059,"y":-565,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e1_img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e3_img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"6"},{"id":"e4_x3","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left","color":"3"}]}